Prometheus exporter for the imud IMU daemon
 imud-prometheus connects to imud's local binary stream socket and serves the
 latest fused state — attitude, heading, rate of turn, heave, the sea-state
 statistics, and the fusion/compass-health diagnostics — as Prometheus
 text-format gauges on a local /metrics endpoint, for alerting and Grafana
 dashboards. Pure C, no external dependencies; built on the ABI-stable
 libimud client library.
